  "Nelson:nflow_engine:codegenUnsupported:codeGenerationConstraintBlocks": "Code generation is not supported for constraint (differential-algebraic) blocks; they are solved by the IDAS runtime. Simulate these models with the 'dae' solver instead.",
  "Nelson:nflow_engine:codegenUnsupported:codeGenerationFmuBlocks": "Code generation is not supported for FMU (FMI Co-Simulation) blocks; the generated program cannot embed the FMU runtime. Remove FMU blocks before generating code.",
  "Nelson:nflow_engine:codegenUnsupported:codeGenerationIntegratorExternalReset": "Code generation is not supported for an integrator with an external reset or an external initial condition ('%s'): a discrete event on a continuous state has no C / Rust lowering, and emitting an integrator that never resets would not be this model. Simulate it, or reset through a resettable subsystem.",
  "Nelson:nflow_engine:codegenUnsupported:codeGenerationModelicaBlocks": "Code generation is not supported for Modelica blocks; they are compiled to FMUs for simulation, and generated standalone code cannot embed the FMU runtime. Remove Modelica blocks before generating code.",
  "Nelson:nflow_engine:codegenUnsupported:codeGenerationNelsonFunctionBlocks": "Code generation is not supported for nelsonFunction blocks (they run interpreted Nelson code). Replace them with the expression block or an equivalent subsystem.",
  "Nelson:nflow_engine:codegenUnsupported:codeGenerationNotImplementedBlockTypes": "Code generation is not implemented for these block types: %s",
  "Nelson:nflow_engine:codegenUnsupported:codeGenerationNotSupportedVariableStep": "Code generation is not supported for the variable-step solver '%s': it has no embedded lowering, so the generated fixed-step code would differ from the simulation. Select the fixed-step 'ode4' (RK4) / 'ode1' or the adaptive 'ode45' solver for code generation, or simulate this model.",
  "Nelson:nflow_engine:codegenUnsupported:codeGenerationNotYetSupportedA": "Code generation is not yet supported for a multi-rate SampleTime on this block type (block '%s'). It is supported on discrete state-holding blocks (unit delay, difference, counters, edge and change detectors); for other blocks remove the per-block SampleTime or simulate with the solver instead.",
  "Nelson:nflow_engine:codegenUnsupported:codeGenerationNotYetSupportedConditional": "Code generation is not yet supported for conditional execution (%s, block '%s'): the control-port gate and if/switchCase/merge action selection have no C/Rust lowering. Simulate these models with the solver instead.",
  "Nelson:nflow_engine:codegenUnsupported:codeGenerationPhysicalIsland": "Code generation for this physical (acausal) island is not supported: the embedded-Newton lowering (C and Rust) covers resistor/conductor/capacitor/inductor/source/sensor/diode/radiation islands, but this one uses a component kind outside that set. Simulate these models with the 'dae' solver instead.",
  "Nelson:nflow_engine:codegenUnsupported:codeGenerationThisPlanarMechanicalIsland": "Code generation for this planar mechanical island is not supported: the joint-free lowering (C and Rust) covers bodies, loads, spring-dampers and position/speed/frame sensors, but this island uses the component kind '%s', which needs the runtime DAE solver. Simulate these models with the 'dae' solver instead.",
  "Nelson:nflow_engine:evaluatorUnavailable": "Function evaluator is not available.",
  "Nelson:nflow_engine:fmuExportFailed": "FMU export: %s",
  "Nelson:nflow_engine:fmuExportUnsupported": "FMU export is not supported for conditional execution (%s, block '%s').",
  "Nelson:nflow_engine:fmuExportUnsupported:fMUExportModelContainsBlockTypes": "FMU export: the model contains block types with no code generation.",
  "Nelson:nflow_engine:fmuExportUnsupported:fMUExportNotSupportedVariableStep": "FMU export is not supported for the variable-step solver '%s': it has no embedded lowering, so the exported FMU would integrate fixed-step and differ from the simulation. Select the fixed-step 'ode4' (RK4) / 'ode1' or the adaptive 'ode45' solver for FMU export.",
  "Nelson:nflow_engine:fmuExportUnsupported:fMUExportNotYetSupportedA": "FMU export is not yet supported for a multi-rate SampleTime on this block type (block '%s'). It is supported on discrete state-holding blocks (unit delay, difference, counters, edge and change detectors); for other blocks remove the per-block SampleTime.",
  "Nelson:nflow_engine:fmuExportUnsupported:fMUExportSupportsScalarFloat64Int64": "FMU export supports scalar Float64 / Int64 / UInt64 boundary signals; the port '%s' has no scalar FMI type (e.g. a bus). Split it before exporting.",
